{"unit_id":"Existence001100__dsh-budget-guard-plugin#feature-1","repo":"Existence001100/dsh-budget-guard-plugin","commit":"387a9fcf36c366ab81fabc8acc959b0bd5dd1550","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Budget Guard 的功能「会话预算拦截」：按金额与 Token 累计量检查会话限额。auto 模式超限时取消当前轮并拒绝下一步；manual 模式则提示用户继续或中止。可用 /budget 设置当前会话预算。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2358","lib/index.js:2397","lib/index.js:2424"]}
{"unit_id":"Existence001100__dsh-budget-guard-plugin#feature-2","repo":"Existence001100/dsh-budget-guard-plugin","commit":"387a9fcf36c366ab81fabc8acc959b0bd5dd1550","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Budget Guard 的功能「用量计费」：读取 assistant/message usage 统计输入、输出和缓存 Token，并结合事件时间及模型价格累计费用。金额和 Token 是独立预算线，任一达到阈值即可触发处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2228","lib/pricing.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Existence001100__dsh-budget-guard-plugin#feature-3","repo":"Existence001100/dsh-budget-guard-plugin","commit":"387a9fcf36c366ab81fabc8acc959b0bd5dd1550","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Budget Guard 的功能「每轮预算进度」：结束一轮后显示预算进度与近期消耗速率；识别到模型明确计划时才估算剩余步数和消耗。结果可显示在对话卡片或侧栏，无需额外模型调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:430","lib/client.js:30"]}
{"unit_id":"Existence001100__dsh-budget-guard-plugin#feature-4","repo":"Existence001100/dsh-budget-guard-plugin","commit":"387a9fcf36c366ab81fabc8acc959b0bd5dd1550","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Budget Guard 的功能「预算命令」：使用 /budget 设置或查看当前会话预算，也可继续、解除或恢复拦截、清除会话覆盖，以及查看价格和调试信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2424","lib/index.js:2228"]}
{"unit_id":"Existence001100__dsh-budget-guard-plugin#caveat-1","repo":"Existence001100/dsh-budget-guard-plugin","commit":"387a9fcf36c366ab81fabc8acc959b0bd5dd1550","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Budget Guard 使用前须知：未识别价格的模型会以估算金额参与拦截判定，界面会区分已知费用与未知价格估算；计价表可由内置值、随包价格文件及本地价格文件合并提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1","lib/pricing.js:1"]}
